GeoScanAI - Earth API Study Tasks
==================================

GOAL
----
Study earth-api, understand its architecture, and reuse only
the useful ideas inside the GeoScanAI Python engine.

RULE
----
Do NOT copy the project blindly.
For every task:
1. Understand it.
2. Test it.
3. Document what we learned.
4. Decide whether GeoScanAI needs it.
5. Only then implement/adapt it.


